// Warburg

// HISTORY

// Arachnos Rising
"RecluseHistory3" "Warburg is a symbol of Arachnos' strength. The city is dedicated to the many faceless soldiers who have given their lives to the cause of our benevolent dictator during the Arachnos Revolution of 1964. Warburg was once protected by a ring of nuclear-tipped rockets capable of striking both North America and Europe, but those were removed under an extortive 'treaty' with Paragon City in 1982."


// TOURISM

// Weapon of Mass Destruction
"Warburg1" "The sole remaining Warburg Rocket was hidden within the facade of the Unger Building, but this was blown away when Marshal Blitz seized control of the island."

// Tunnel Rat
"Warburg2" "The various tunnels throughout the Web are a nasty piece of work."

// Triumphant
"Warburg3" "The statue of Lord Recluse lording over a fallen Statesman speaks to long past-triumphs.  Warburg visitors can draw their own conclusions as to just how revisionist this history is."